{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47277","headline":"游仙二十四首 十四 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"予昇至阳元，欲憩明霞馆。\n飘飘琼轮举，晔晔金景散。\n结虚成万有，高妙咸可翫。\n玉山郁嵯峨，琅海杳无岸。\n蹔赏过千椿，遐龄谁复算。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}